{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06921","headline":"宿五度溪仙人得道处 · 常建","name":"宿五度溪仙人得道处","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五度溪上花，生根依两崖。\n二月寻片云，愿宿秦人家。\n上见悬崖崩，下见白水湍。\n仙人弹碁处，石上青萝盘。\n无处求玉童，翳翳唯林峦。\n前溪遇新月，聊取玉琴弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}